# PussStage versions source, scripts, docs and config only.
#
# Content (46 GB), DerivedAssets, Transfers and Backups are binary and are
# protected by full snapshots to D:\PussStageBackups instead. See
# Docs/Conductor/CONTAINER_WORLD_PLAN_2026-09-25.md.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the root, then re-include what is worth
# versioning. That way a new large folder is excluded by default rather than
# accidentally committed.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md
!/PussStage.uproject
!/Config/
!/Docs/
!/Scripts/
!/Tools/
!/go1_pi_bridge/
!/Plugins/
!/Saved/

# Plugins: our two plugins' source only. MCPBlueprintsGenerator and
# StageWingCutoutPipeline each carry their own git repository and are left alone.
Plugins/*
!Plugins/InfinityStage/
!Plugins/Go1Input/
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/

# Saved: the guarded MCP scripts have to live under Saved/ because the project
# Python executor refuses paths outside it. Version those, never logs, captures,
# caches or mocap payloads.
# Version the tooling and the specs it reads - never its outputs. Result,
# verify, dump and QC JSONs regenerate on every run and belong in the D: snapshot
# and in handover references, not in the history.
Saved/*
!Saved/Codex*/
Saved/Codex*/**
!Saved/Codex*/**/
!Saved/Codex*/**/*.py
!Saved/Codex*/**/*_request.json
!Saved/Codex*/**/lighting_plan.json
!Saved/Codex*/**/light_adjust.json
!Saved/Codex*/**/expected_changes.json

*.pdb
*.sln
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
